+            "classify everything D-2-or-older as stale. USER-INVOKED, NEVER "
+            "AUTOMATIC (trigger phrases: 'clean the archive' / 'archive cleanup'). "
+            "DRY-RUN by default — pass force=True to actually git rm -rf the stale "
